            "value": "自動制御をオンにする"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns automatic detection off. Use the menu-bar button or keyboard shortcut to hide and show the bar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭自动检测。使用菜单栏按钮或键盘快捷键显示/隐藏菜单栏。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動検出をオフにします。メニューバーのボタンまたはキーボードショートカットで表示／非表示を切り替えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "バージョン %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visible until the app changes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换应用前保持显示"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリを切り替えるまで表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待批准"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "許可待ち"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval in System Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待系统设置中的批准。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "システム設定での許可待ちです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for playback": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待播放"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再生待ち"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an app is excluded, Barveil leaves the menu bar exactly as it is whenever that app is in front.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用被排除后，只要它位于前台，Barveil 就不会改动菜单栏。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリを除外すると、そのアプリが前面にある間は Barveil がメニューバーを変更しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When full screen is paused": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全屏暂停时"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フルスクリーン一時停止時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While Barveil is running, it uses a consistent visible baseline and temporarily hides the menu bar only during playback. Your original full-screen menu-bar setting is restored when Barveil is turned off or quit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barveil 运行期间会使用统一的可见基线，只在播放时临时隐藏菜单栏。关闭 Barveil 或退出后，会恢复你原来的全屏菜单栏设置。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barveil の実行中は一貫した表示ベースを使い、再生中だけメニューバーを一時的に隠します。Barveil をオフにするか終了すると、元のフルスクリーン用メニューバー設定に戻ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why this state?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为什么是这个状态？"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この状態の理由"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windowed video and ordinary full-screen windows are left alone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口视频和普通全屏窗口不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ウインドウ表示の動画や通常のフルスクリーンウインドウには影響しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "はい"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also exclude the current app directly from the Barveil panel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以直接从 Barveil 面板排除当前应用。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barveil パネルから現在のアプリを直接除外することもできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current macOS menu-bar setting is preserved while automation is off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动控制关闭期间，会保留你当前的 macOS 菜单栏设置。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動制御がオフの間、現在の macOS メニューバー設定は保持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Keep Hidden” leaves the menu bar out of the way until the full-screen picture closes. This choice has no effect in manual mode.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“保持隐藏”会让菜单栏一直退场，直到关闭全屏画面。手动模式下无效。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「隠したまま」はフルスクリーン画面を閉じるまでメニューバーを退けたままにします。手動モードでは効果がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
